  <div class="field"><label for="situation">What actually happened? *</label><textarea id="situation" required></textarea><small class="helper">Situation text is sent to an AI service for generation. Include only details you may share.</small></div>
  <div class="two"><div class="field"><label for="priority">What matters to them?</label><input id="priority"></div><div class="field"><label for="lastContact">Time since contact</label><input id="lastContact"></div></div><div class="field"><label for="trigger">Verified trigger (optional)</label><textarea id="trigger"></textarea></div><div class="field"><label for="nextStep">Desired next step</label><input id="nextStep"></div><button class="primary" id="submitButton">Build four outreach plays</button><p class="privacy">Prospect details are never sent to GHL. Only your contact details entered for PDF download and anonymous interaction metadata are relayed.</p>
</form><section class="result-panel" aria-live="polite"><div id="status" class="status" role="status"></div><div id="emptyState" class="empty"><div><h2>The message comes second.</h2><p>First find a legitimate reason they should want to hear from you.</p></div></div><div id="results" class="results"><div class="diagnosis"><span class="section-label">Situation diagnosis</span><h2 id="diagnosisTitle">Relevance before repetition.</h2><p id="diagnosisCopy" class="muted"></p></div><div class="actions"><button id="downloadPdf" class="primary" type="button">Download PDF</button></div><div class="section-label">Four ranked plays — select one</div><div id="reasonList" class="reasons"></div><div id="scorecard" class="scorecard"></div><div id="playPlan" class="plan"></div><div class="section-label">What you can say</div><div id="channels" class="channels" role="tablist"></div><p class="disclaimer">Recommendations only—nothing is sent, ordered, or mailed by this demo.</p><div id="messageText" class="message"></div><button id="copyButton" class="secondary" type="button">Copy wording</button>
<section id="feedback" class="feedback"><h3>Would you use this?</h3><div class="feedback-buttons"><button type="button" class="secondary" data-feedback="Yes as-is">Yes as-is</button><button type="button" class="secondary" data-feedback="With edits">With edits</button><button type="button" class="secondary" data-feedback="No">No</button></div><div id="feedbackDetail" class="feedback-detail"><label for="feedbackMissing">What’s missing? (optional)</label><input id="feedbackMissing"><button id="feedbackSubmit" class="primary" type="button">Submit feedback</button></div><p id="feedbackThanks" role="status"></p></section><section id="contactBlock" class="contact"></section></div></section></div></section></main>
