<footer><div class="shell footer"><img src="Airstrike_Marketing_logo_design_300_DPI.png" alt="Airstrike Marketing"><span>Reason to Reach Out demo</span><span>© Airstrike Marketing</span></div></footer><script src="pdf-lib.min.js"></script><script src="app.js"></script></body></html>

