I’ve found the main gaps: the contact and feedback copy are still the earlier version, browser generation has no abort timeout, the browser assumes several secure-context APIs exist, and the relay currently swallows failures and only notes a subset of events. I’m adding tests around those behaviors now, including a fully mocked LeadConnector adapter so automated tests cannot reach the live service.
